* Leverage our experience with identity providers like Active Directory/LDAP and Keycloak to ensure secure authentication and authorization.
* Ensure that all components of the solution are sourced from European suppliers to avoid dependencies on non-European vendors.

By following this proposed architecture, we can meet the client's requirements while leveraging our existing expertise and technology stack.
